{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"meta"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"index"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"单纯百科 Simplopedia"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<img src=\"/assets/simplopedia.svg\" alt=\"Simplopedia\" style=\"float: right; width: min(200px,30vw); margin-right: 20px; margin-top:-50px; filter: drop-shadow(5px 5px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));\">\n<p>这里是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯百科","text":"单纯百科"}},{"Plain":"的主目录.</p>\n<p>欢迎访问<span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=zh\" title=\"我的个人主页 [https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=zh]\">我的个人主页</a></span>.</p>\n<p>You may also want to visit <span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=en\" title=\"my personal main page [https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=en]\">my personal main page</a></span> (in English).</p>\n<p>可以试试"},{"Local":{"url":"search","text":"搜索单纯百科的页面"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>欢迎所有读者在页面下方发布"},{"Local":{"url":"comments","text":"评论"}},{"Plain":", 或<span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"mailto:wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn\" title=\"通过邮箱联系我 [mailto:wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn]\">通过邮箱联系我</a></span> <code>wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn</code> , 交流, 催更. (对于好友, 通过微信或 QQ 联系我当然是更加欢迎的.)</p>\n<h2>分类</h2>\n<p>单纯百科的页面分为以下几类.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>百科 : 数学概念. 这类页面构成了单纯百科的主体.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"notion","text":"观念"}},{"Plain":" : 模糊而普遍的数学思想.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"pedagogy","text":"教学"}},{"Plain":" : 面向基础读者的科普.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"notes","text":"讲稿, 笔记"}},{"Plain":" : 一些讨论班的讲稿, 文献的阅读笔记, 以及零散的见闻.</li>\n<li>文献 : 其它页面中引用到的参考文献.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"subject","text":"学科"}},{"Plain":" : 用于部分页面的收集和分类.</li>\n<li>Meta : 关于单纯百科本身.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"nonmath","text":"非数学"}},{"Plain":" : 一些不属于上述分类, 且不属于数学的东西.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>点击 "},{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}},{"Plain":" 可以看到本站的所有页面.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"todo","text":"亟需施工处"}},{"Plain":"列表 (“TODO list”)</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"terminologies","text":"术语翻译表"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>最近</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Kleisli范畴","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"相对单子","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Blakers–Massey定理","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"代数模式","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"正交分解系","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"始代数","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"P-树","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"自由单子","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Idem","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"游走的收缩","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"加权余极限","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"代数胚","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"多重范畴","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦函子","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Segal范畴Γ","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Joyal范畴","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"杠–余杠对偶","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"辫群","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"超滤","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"分层","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"合聚意象","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"线图","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"代数充实于余代数","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"位象","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"fil-gr","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"中心","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"余端","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"配边范畴","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"谱分解","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url